    "question": "It takes Dawn 2 hours to paint 1 watercolor painting.  She was recently commissioned to paint a series of 12 paintings.  Dawn will earn $3,600.00 for these 12 paintings.  How much money does Dawn make per hour?",
    "gold": "150",
    "answer": "It takes her 2 hours to paint 1 picture and she needs to paint 12 pictures so it will take 2*12 = <<2*12=24>>24 hours\nDawn will make $3,6000.00 for 24 hours of work which means she makes 3600/24 = $150.00 per hour of work\n#### 150"
  },
  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine how much money Dawn makes per hour, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. **Calculate the total time Dawn spends painting the 12 paintings:**\n   - Dawn takes 2 hours to paint 1 painting.\n   - For 12 paintings, the total time is:\n     \\[\n     2 \\text{ hours/painting} \\times 12 \\text{ paintings} = 24 \\text{ hours}\n     \\]\n\n2. **Determine Dawn's hourly wage:**\n   - Dawn earns $3,600 for 24 hours of work.\n   - To find the hourly wage, we divide the total earnings by the total hours worked:\n     \\[\n     \\frac{3600 \\text{ dollars}}{24 \\text{ hours}} = 150 \\text{ dollars/hour}\n     \\]\n\nThus, Dawn makes \\(\\boxed{150}\\) dollars per hour.",
